<title>USA: Gray Communications Systems sets qtly div.</title>
<headline>Gray Communications Systems sets qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, Ga. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gray Communications Systems Inc said it paid quarterly dividends on its class A and class B common stock.</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.02		     $0.02</p>
<p> Pay		  March 31</p>
<p> Record	     March 21</p>
